# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# ONE key is enough — the app walks a chain of free models from `ai-kit` and
# drops any vendor whose key is absent (src/lib/llm.ts). Which names count is
# the chain's answer, not a constant in this repo: if this file ever disagrees
# with it, `npm run analyze` with no key set prints the authoritative list.
#
# Two keys is better than one. A retired or busy model steps aside for the next
# link at the SAME vendor, but a spent daily budget is org-wide — only a second
# vendor has a second meter, and that is the failure the chain exists for.

# Groq — free tier at https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter — free tier at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
